    ignores it, focusing all her attention to slowly moving down the hall. She gives
    her eyes the time to adjust to the dim light.","parentUIDs":[6,12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Evelyn
    Ventress","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":459.000122,"yPos":261.000122},"ID":8,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"She
    tries to push the fear away from her mind, but she shakes as she begins to make
