    Ventress\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":459.000122,\"yPos\":261.000122},\"ID\":8,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Evelyn
    slowly brings down the pace, looking over her shoulder. She jumps at the sound
